Conditions:
If balance sufficient
If amount % 100 == 0 → allow
Else → invalid denomination
Else → insufficient balance


Electricity Bill
Input: units
Conditions:
If units ≤ 100 → ₹5/unit
Else:
If ≤ 200 → ₹7/unit
Else → ₹10/unit

